06:21.654 --> 06:24.055
Oh, yeah. Little guy's got scoliosis.

06:24.056 --> 06:25.590
Oh, my God.

06:25.591 --> 06:28.693
Oh, no, am I gonna be a
big-shoe, small-shoe guy?

06:28.694 --> 06:30.128
But don't worry, he'll be fine.

06:30.129 --> 06:32.030
He just needs to wear
this brace for a while

06:32.031 --> 06:34.032
- to correct it.
- Oh, dear.

06:34.033 --> 06:36.401
Now, does he have any
school pictures coming up?

06:36.402 --> 06:37.969
Yeah, he actually does.

06:37.970 --> 06:39.070
Well, then, this will not be

06:39.071 --> 06:41.456
