charges will be dropped.

06:51.417 --> 06:52.984
Hey, sorry again, you guys.

06:52.985 --> 06:54.119
Ah, no harm done.

06:54.120 --> 06:55.754
Yeah, no hard feelings, fellas.

06:55.755 --> 06:57.322
I've already forgotten about it.

06:57.323 --> 06:59.624
