my hot date tonight.

06:59.625 --> 07:01.426
Yeah, right. "Hot date."

07:01.427 --> 07:03.261
With your left hand or your right hand?

07:03.262 --> 07:06.097
Actually, I use both and
do, like, an Indian burn.

07:06.098 --> 07:07.899
