- Nope.

07:28.621 --> 07:30.422
Just two horny people with phones.

07:30.423 --> 07:31.590
Wait, I don't get it.

07:31.591 --> 07:34.192
So you hit 'em on the head with
your phone and knock 'em out?

07:34.193 --> 07:37.062
No, you just swipe someone's picture,
they come over, and you plow 'em.

07:37.063 --> 07:39.297
Wow! I gotta try this.

07:39.298 --> 07:41.166
