08:02.505 --> 08:04.039
I can't wait to start getting laid

08:04.040 --> 08:05.207
at the push of a button.

08:05.208 --> 08:07.075
Well, first you got to
set up your profile.

08:07.076 --> 08:10.245
Oh, yeah, I've been working on that.
I wrote several long paragraphs

08:10.246 --> 08:12.614
describing my interests,
some pet peeves,

08:12.615 --> 08:15.317
choice of wine, a couple
of inspirational quotes,

08:15.318 --> 08:16.952
things I've learned from my cats...

08:16.953 --> 08:18.153
No, no, no, no. None of that.

08:18.154 --> 08:20.122
You want a naked bathroom selfie

08:20.123 --> 08:22.891
