08:31.401 --> 08:33.802
That's interesting. I
wonder what beach that is.

08:33.803 --> 08:35.137
No, no, no. Give me that.

08:35.138 --> 08:36.672
Here, you see this? You
see what I'm doing?

08:36.673 --> 08:38.507
Not even looking. I'm swiping "yes."

08:38.508 --> 08:41.043
Yes, yes, yes. Casting a wide net.

08:41.044 --> 08:42.273
Heh, look at this.

08:42.274 --> 08:44.376
You already got a hit.
And she sent a message.

08:44.377 --> 08:46.948
She did? What am I looking at here?

08:46.949 --> 08:49.084
It's mostly small, colorful pictures.

08:49.085 --> 08:51.086
Those are emojis. Read 'em.

08:51.087 --> 08:53.655
Okay, it says "Hey,"
and then a kissy face,

08:53.656 --> 08:56.291
and then, like, a saucy, smirking face,

08:56.292 --> 08:58.160
three balloons, and a locomotive.

08:58.161 --> 08:59.227
What the hell is all this?

08:59.228 --> 09:01.596
Maybe she likes you.
Send something back.

09:01.597 --> 09:05.300
Okay. "Dearest Theresa, I
hope this finds you well.

09:05.301 --> 09:07.836
I so appreciated your
last communication..."

09:07.837 --> 09:09.930
No, stop, stop! God, stop, stop!

09:09.931 --> 09:12.477
Just send her an eggplant
and the erupting volcano.

09:19.680 --> 09:21.496
All right, take a gander.

09:21.497 --> 09:23.599
Gawk at the Elephant Man.
Let's get it all out.

09:23.600 --> 09:26.702
