10:11.514 --> 10:13.548
Hi, are you Courtney, from Tinder?

10:13.549 --> 10:15.450
You must be Glenn. I got you these.

10:15.451 --> 10:17.352
A lovely bouquet for a lovely...

10:17.353 --> 10:19.588
Yeah, take off your pants and
