- Of course not.

10:32.802 --> 10:36.071
Here, wipe yourself off
with this West Elm catalog.

10:36.072 --> 10:38.183
My God, this app is amazing!

10:38.184 --> 10:40.265
Thank you, cell-phone Jesus.

10:41.428 --> 10:42.944
Huh?

10:42.945 --> 10:44.499
Oh, yeah, fine.

11:34.414 --> 11:36.264
So, how's it going with the back brace?

11:36.265 --> 11:38.934
- Are people giving you a hard time?
- Quite the contrary, Brian.

11:38.935 --> 11:41.203
Apparently, people love the wretched.

11:41.204 --> 11:42.971
Thanks to this thing,
I was offered seats

11:42.972 --> 11:45.724
