11:48.261 --> 11:51.780
Wow, that patient next
door is fat.

11:51.781 --> 11:53.048
I can hear you.

11:53.049 --> 11:55.117
Uh, that wasn't me,
that was Mrs. Griffin.

11:55.118 --> 11:57.152
So, I've got Stewie's results here.

11:57.153 --> 11:58.653
Um, it appears the back brace

11:58.654 --> 12:00.522
