12:00.523 --> 12:01.757
That's wonderful.

12:01.758 --> 12:03.759
Stewie doesn't have to
wear the brace anymore.

12:03.760 --> 12:05.994
What? No! I can't give this thing up.

12:05.995 --> 12:07.095
Wait, what do you mean?

12:07.096 --> 12:09.598
- You want to keep wearing the brace?
- Of course I do.

12:09.599 --> 12:11.333
It's the best thing that's
ever happened to me.

12:11.334 --> 12:12.601
When I wear this brace,

12:12.602 --> 12:14.803
I get pampered like
the Queen of England.

12:14.804 --> 12:18.640
So, I have the most money
