12:34.374 --> 12:36.158
All right, hitting the links.

12:36.159 --> 12:38.994
Joe, golf shorts may not
be the right look for you.

12:38.995 --> 12:40.195
It's gonna be a nice day.

12:40.196 --> 12:41.763
Not for us, if you wear those.

12:41.764 --> 12:43.465
Well, that seems a little hurtful.

12:43.466 --> 12:46.134
Hey, where's Quagmire? Our
