12:47.056 --> 12:50.121
I haven't seen much of him
since he discovered Tinder.

12:54.444 --> 12:55.660
Tinder?

13:03.036 --> 13:05.020
Quagmire, come on. It's time for golf.

13:05.021 --> 13:07.022
I swipe "no" on golf.

13:07.023 --> 13:09.858
