13:47.178 --> 13:48.489
You got to stop this.

13:48.490 --> 13:50.991
It looks like you haven't
left this room in weeks.

13:50.992 --> 13:53.694
No need to leave. They all come here.

13:53.695 --> 13:56.297
Sometimes they bring burgers and cheese.

13:56.298 --> 13:58.499
Hey, come on, Quagmire,
let's go for a walk, huh?

13:58.500 --> 14:00.568
